---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Cyber Crime Defence in Chennai" description="Defence in online fraud, banking fraud, and IT Act cases.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <p class="text-gold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Practice Area</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-navy mb-6">Cyber Crime</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg text-ink/90 space-y-5 leading-relaxed">
      <p>Cyber crime investigations involve digital evidence, intermediary liability, and overlapping provisions under the Information Technology Act and the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita. Common matters include online fraud, UPI/banking fraud, data theft, and social media offences.</p>
      <p>We assist in responding to notices, challenging improper seizure of devices, and evaluating the strength of digital evidence. Early advice is important before statements are recorded or devices are surrendered.</p>
      <p>Representation is available before cyber crime police stations, Magistrate courts, and the Madras High Court.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10">
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-navy text-cream px-8 py-3 rounded-sm hover:bg-navy/90 transition">Get Legal Advice</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
